body.translated_text:
In the midst of the space-element, contemplate the <s>maṇḍala</s> born of all <s>vajras</s>;
one should perform the absorption, if one wishes to hold the peaceful <s>vajra</s>.
The body of humans is certainly seen as fivefold, consisting of the five elements;
through the presence and absence of those, establishing one's own mind — thus the <s>Buddhas</s> become manifest.

In the <s>Mūlasūtra</s> also it is said:
By practicing difficult and severe austerities, one does not attain <s>siddhi</s>;
but by practicing with all sensual enjoyments, one quickly attains <s>siddhi</s>.
